  "details": "Description\n\nIn VRChat's chatbox and any text fields, using voice input for long texts will inevitably drop a few characters. Windows' built-in voice input also fails to work occasionally. Pasting text does not have this issue.\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nThis issue triggers whenever voice input is used. I have confirmed with a friend, and they are experiencing this exact same problem after updating.\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: 用户界面\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.3-1919-27c41b24d2-Release\n\nunityVersion: 6000.0.67f1-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report",
